 "description": "<div class=\"detailmodule_dynamic\">\n <kse:widget data-widget-type=\"relatedProduct\" id=\"22222316\" title=\"\" type=\"relation\"></kse:widget>\n</div> \n<div class=\"detailmodule_text-image\">\n <p><b>Overview:<br></b></p>\n <p>The protective inflatable collar recovery cone for dogs and cats comes with a soft plush adjustable strap for pet surgery, wound healing, anti-scald and scratching.</p>\n <p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Product material：.</span></p>\n <p>Product name: pet collar anti-bite ring<br></p>\n <p>Product color: blue, grey<br>Product size: Xs, S, ML, XL<br>Product net weight: subject to the actual product<br>Suitable for pets: cats, dogs</p>\n <p>Material: PVC + plush&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p>\n <p><br></p>\n <p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Size Information：</span></p>\n <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n  <tbody>\n   <tr>\n    <th>&nbsp;size</th>\n    <th>&nbsp;Length and width</th>\n    <th><p>Neck diameter</p></th>\n    <th><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Neck circumference</span>&nbsp;</th>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td>&nbsp;XS（cm）</td>\n    <td>&nbsp;16x17</td>\n    <td>3-4</td>\n    <td>&nbsp;12-20</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td>&nbsp;S （cm）</td>\n    <td>&nbsp;22x23</td>\n    <td>4-5</td>\n    <td>&nbsp;18-30</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td>&nbsp;M （cm）</td>\n    <td>&nbsp;27x27</td>\n    <td>7-8</td>\n    <td>&nbsp;25-36</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td>&nbsp;L （cm）</td>\n    <td>&nbsp;40x40</td>\n    <td>13</td>\n    <td>&nbsp;38-50</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td>&nbsp;XL （cm）</td>\n    <td>&nbsp;45x44</td>\n    <td>18</td>\n    <td>&nbsp;50-65</td>\n   </tr>\n  </tbody>\n </table>\n <p><b>Package Content：</b><br></p>\n <p>1*collar</p>\n <p><img alt=\"无题会话02258.jpg\" height=\"526.2552083333333\" src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/16778016/1631557233202565120.jpg\" width=\"790\" max-width=\"790\"><br><img alt=\"无题会话02257.jpg\" height=\"526.2552083333333\" src